  change modelSubgroup.subtype (localGenerators 0) * modelSubgroup.subtype (gen1 0) *
    (modelSubgroup.subtype (localGenerators 0))⁻¹ = (modelSubgroup.subtype (gen1 0))⁻¹
  simp only [CatalogueCertificate.localPermutation_eq,perm1_eq] at he
  exact he
